  "version_description": "NVIDIA NIM 1.7.0 packaging for MIT/Recursion Boltz-2 structure and affinity prediction. The 2026-05-31T09Z cycle live-upserted this hidden onboarding row and ran a fresh digest-pinned four-cell matrix with 3 warmups plus 10 measured requests on B200, B300, H200, and L40S. The 2026-06-04T06Z cycle added H100/eu-north1 support with the same 3-warmup/10-run protocol. The 2026-05-31T10Z cycle retried RTX6000/us-central1, but the probe inventory still had no matching cell. Promoted to the public preview catalog on 2026-06-30 after attesting (via image OCI-config inspection) that this NIM runs a PyTorch backend with no NVIDIA Triton Inference Server, so it is outside the surface of NVIDIA Security Bulletin 5828. RTX6000 remains classified unsupported pending an inventory cell.",
